I am a Masters student working on Maxent modeling for habitat correlates of a titi monkey species from Peru. The distribution area is greater than 10 sq.km <http://sq.km/> but confined to Northern Peru. I want to use the current climatic variables from Worldclim and other ecological and anthropogenic variables like NDVI, Land cover, Human population intensity, Intensity of anthropogenic disturbance, distance to road, etc., Where can I download these variables other than Worldclim? or How can I create them for this species? Do we need to process them or can upload directly on User-specified variables in Wallace? I have basic knowledge of Maxent modeling. But I would like to learn. Kindly clarify.

